  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study, gender</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie, genderprojekt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rdjupa demokratin i Lettland och Litauen genom att &#xf6;ka kvinnors deltagande i politiken. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;ratt genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie i Lettland och Litauen f&#xf6;r att ta fram ett projektf&#xf6;rslag r&#xf6;rande j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet inom politiken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to deepen democracy in Latvia and Lithuania by increasing woment&apos;s participation in politics. The aim of the pro- ject is to conduct a feasibility study in Latvia and Lithuania in order to produce a project proposal regarding gender in politics.</narrative>
  </description>
